{"seq":2,"slug":"data-quality","title":"数据质量与维度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-centric-ai/foundations/data-quality","wordCount":1562,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据质量与维度\">数据质量与维度</h1><p>「这批数据质量不行」是机器学习团队最常说也最没用的一句话——它没说清到底是哪里不行。本篇的任务就是把「质量」这个团雾拆成若干可定义、可度量、可分别治理的维度。一旦能说出「问题出在一致性维度，准确率维度其实没问题」，治理动作就有了明确靶点。这套维度词汇是全 hub 共用的：后面讲清洗、增强、偏差时，都会回指到这里的某个具体维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据质量不是单一标量，而是一组相互独立又彼此牵制的维度。借鉴数据管理领域的经典框架并结合机器学习的特殊需求，本 hub 采用六个核心维度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>典型缺陷</th>\n<th>主要治理篇</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>准确性</td>\n<td>标签/取值与真实情况相符</td>\n<td>错标、测量误差</td>\n<td><a href=\"../curation/cleaning-debugging\">清洗与数据调试</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整性</td>\n<td>该有的字段/样本没有缺失</td>\n<td>空值、漏采</td>\n<td><a href=\"../curation/augmentation\">数据增强</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>同类样本标注规则统一</td>\n<td>标注者间分歧</td>\n<td><a href=\"../curation/labeling-annotation\">标注与众包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效性</td>\n<td>数据反映当前而非过期分布</td>\n<td>概念漂移</td>\n<td><a href=\"data-lifecycle\">数据生命周期</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表性</td>\n<td>覆盖真实部署分布与各子群</td>\n<td>长尾缺失、群体失衡</td>\n<td><a href=\"../practice/bias-fairness-data\">数据偏差与公平</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>唯一性</td>\n<td>无重复与近重复</td>\n<td>重复样本、泄漏</td>\n<td><a href=\"../synthetic/data-selection-pruning\">数据选择与剪枝</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>下图展示这六个维度如何共同支撑「可训练资产」这个目标，以及它们各自的失效会从哪个方向侵蚀模型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Q[可训练的高质量数据] --&gt; A[准确性]&#10;  Q --&gt; C[完整性]&#10;  Q --&gt; S[一致性]&#10;  Q --&gt; T[时效性]&#10;  Q --&gt; R[代表性]&#10;  Q --&gt; U[唯一性]&#10;  A --&gt;|错标| E1[学习到错误映射]&#10;  S --&gt;|标注分歧| E2[标签噪声升高]&#10;  R --&gt;|子群缺失| E3[长尾与公平性崩坏]&#10;  U --&gt;|重复泄漏| E4[评测虚高 / 过拟合]\">flowchart TD\n  Q[可训练的高质量数据] --&gt; A[准确性]\n  Q --&gt; C[完整性]\n  Q --&gt; S[一致性]\n  Q --&gt; T[时效性]\n  Q --&gt; R[代表性]\n  Q --&gt; U[唯一性]\n  A --&gt;|错标| E1[学习到错误映射]\n  S --&gt;|标注分歧| E2[标签噪声升高]\n  R --&gt;|子群缺失| E3[长尾与公平性崩坏]\n  U --&gt;|重复泄漏| E4[评测虚高 / 过拟合]</pre><h2 id=\"准确性与一致性-最易混淆的一对\">准确性与一致性：最易混淆的一对</h2><p>准确性问得是「标得对不对」，一致性问得是「标得齐不齐」，两者常被混为一谈但治理手段完全不同。</p>\n<p>一个标注团队可能高度一致却系统性地错——所有人都按一份错误的规范把「斑马」标成「马」，一致性满分而准确性为零。反过来，团队也可能各自标得都对，却因规范模糊在边界样本上分歧不断，准确性尚可而一致性糟糕。</p>\n<p>一致性可以量化。对分类任务，常用 Cohen&#39;s Kappa 衡量两个标注者扣除随机一致后的真实一致程度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa = \\frac{p_o - p_e}{1 - p_e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是实际观测一致率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是随机情况下的期望一致率。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 越接近 1 越一致。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 偏低，问题在标注规范而非标注者，需要回到 <a href=\"../curation/labeling-annotation\">标注与众包</a> 去打磨指南；当一致性高但准确性存疑，则要靠 <a href=\"../curation/cleaning-debugging\">清洗与数据调试</a> 的置信学习去揪系统性错标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代表性-把分布而非样本当一等公民\">代表性：把分布而非样本当一等公民</h2><p>前面四个维度关心单个样本对不对、全不全，代表性则关心整批数据的分布形状对不对。</p>\n<p>代表性失衡是工业模型最隐蔽的杀手。训练集若在某个子群（如某肤色人群、某方言、某长尾类别）上样本极少，模型在该子群上的表现会系统性塌陷，而总体指标却可能很漂亮。度量代表性的一种方式是比较训练分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{train}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与部署分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{deploy}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">oy</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的散度，例如 KL 散度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>x</mi></munder><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{KL}(P_{deploy} \\,\\|\\, P_{train}) = \\sum_x P_{deploy}(x)\\log\\frac{P_{deploy}(x)}{P_{train}(x)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">oy</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.677em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">oy</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">oy</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>散度越大，训练分布越偏离真实。代表性失衡若落在受保护属性上，就直接成为公平性问题——这正是 <a href=\"../practice/bias-fairness-data\">数据偏差与公平</a> 的主题；而欧盟《AI 法案》第 10 条把「代表性」明确写入高风险系统的法定要求，见 <a href=\"../practice/data-governance\">数据治理与合规</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"维度间的权衡\">维度间的权衡</h2><p>六个维度并非各自独立优化就能全赢，它们之间存在真实张力，治理时必须有取舍意识。</p>\n<p>最典型的是完整性与时效性的冲突：为了凑齐完整样本而长期累积，会让早期数据过期；为了保证时效而只用近期数据，又可能在某些子群上不完整。另一组张力在唯一性与代表性之间：激进去重能提升唯一性，却可能误删稀有但真实的长尾样本，反伤代表性——这一权衡在 <a href=\"../synthetic/data-selection-pruning\">数据选择与剪枝</a> 里会再次出现。</p>\n<p>理解这些张力的意义在于：质量治理不是把每个维度推到极致，而是依据下游任务的代价函数做加权取舍。一个欺诈检测系统也许愿意牺牲一点完整性换准确性，一个客服系统则可能优先时效性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"反模式-把质量当一次性验收\">反模式：把质量当一次性验收</h3><p>维度清单容易被误用成一张「开工前打勾、验收后归档」的检查表，这恰是治理失效的开端。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一次性验收</td>\n<td>只在建集时体检一遍</td>\n<td>维度随分布漂移而悄悄劣化</td>\n<td>把维度指标接进监控持续复查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单指标优化</td>\n<td>只盯准确性分</td>\n<td>一致性/代表性被压垮</td>\n<td>分维度度量，按代价加权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混用两概念</td>\n<td>用一致性高证明准确性好</td>\n<td>系统性错标被掩盖</td>\n<td>准确性与一致性分别测量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个可操作的判据是：每个维度都应有对应的度量、阈值与责任篇。说不清某维度由谁在哪个阶段负责，就说明它还没被真正纳入治理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数据质量是六个维度的集合——准确性、完整性、一致性、时效性、代表性、唯一性——而非单一标量。</li>\n<li>准确性与一致性极易混淆：前者问「对不对」，后者问「齐不齐」，可用 Cohen&#39;s Kappa 量化一致性，且高一致不等于高准确。</li>\n<li>代表性关心的是整批数据的分布形状，可用训练与部署分布的 KL 散度度量，失衡落在受保护属性上即成公平性问题。</li>\n<li>各维度间存在真实张力（完整性 vs 时效性、唯一性 vs 代表性），治理应按下游代价加权取舍而非一律推满。</li>\n<li>这套维度词汇是全 hub 的公共坐标，后续每篇治理方法都对应修复其中某个具体维度。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据质量与维度","id":"数据质量与维度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"准确性与一致性：最易混淆的一对","id":"准确性与一致性-最易混淆的一对"},{"level":2,"text":"代表性：把分布而非样本当一等公民","id":"代表性-把分布而非样本当一等公民"},{"level":2,"text":"维度间的权衡","id":"维度间的权衡"},{"level":3,"text":"反模式：把质量当一次性验收","id":"反模式-把质量当一次性验收"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据为中心范式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-centric-ai/foundations/why-data-centric"},"next":{"title":"数据生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-centric-ai/foundations/data-lifecycle"}}